      <!-- .row -->
      <div class="row">
        <div style="margin-bottom: 50px;" class="col-xs-12">
          <h2>Diagnose and Calibration</h2>
          <p>Detailed Diagnose and Calibration information and procedures are in the <a href="/refGuide"
              title="Cassini Reference Guide">Cassini Reference Guide</a>, CH 5:
            Diagnose and CH 6: Calibration.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Diagnostic Kits: custom interface fixture, cables and components needed to self-diagnose issues.
              (included with system order, required for Calibration)</li>
            <li><a
                href="/commerce/catalog.nsf/accessoriesbyType?openform&RestrictToCategory=Calibration+Tools">Calibration
                Kits</a>: used to calibrate RF system, frequency dependant.</li>
            <li><a href="/docs/RBEH-6XH5L4">Calibration - Written Procedure for Complete Cassini System Cal</a></li>
            <li><a href="/pdf/RoosCalibrationScope_v2.0.pdf">Calibration Scope (DC-88 GHz)</a></li>
          </ul>
